<div style="background: #f8f9fa; padding: 14px 18px; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid #9b59b6;"><strong>R-5 (Navalcarnero):</strong> Todas nocturno: <span style="background: #27ae60; color: white; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 15px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 5px;">De 0 a 6 h gratis</span>.</div>
